  "title": "Crazy Good Southern Baked Ham",
  "description": "Picnic ham is basted with a sweet and tangy sauce of sorghum syrup, mustard, and spices, then baked over brewed coffee in a roasting pan.",
  "authors": [
    "FMcLellen"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:13:56-05:00",
